### Production Considerations
- **Error Monitoring**: Integrate with Sentry or similar for error tracking
- **Graceful Degradation**: Provide fallback functionality when errors occur
- **User Experience**: Show meaningful error messages instead of technical details
- **Performance**: Don't let error handling slow down normal operations
- **Security**: Don't expose sensitive information in error messages

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ Not capturing errors in monitoring systems
- ❌ Showing technical error details to end users
- ❌ Not implementing circuit breakers for external services
- ❌ Not handling async errors properly
- ❌ Not providing fallback UI for errors

### Quality Gates
- [ ] All API routes have error handling
- [ ] Server actions handle errors gracefully
- [ ] React error boundaries implemented
- [ ] Circuit breakers for external services
- [ ] Error monitoring integration
- [ ] User-friendly error messages
- [ ] Proper logging of errors
- [ ] Graceful degradation strategies